# Frontend env — two situations only:
#
# DEV (npm run dev): NO file needed. Vite's dev proxy forwards /api and
#   /socket.io to http://localhost:4321 (same origin).
#
# PROD (npm run build -> `vite build --mode prod` reads `.env.prod`):
#   copy this file to `.env.prod` (gitignored) and set the public API base.
#   The SPA is served by nginx at the public host; API calls hit <host>/api.
#   The `/api` suffix is REQUIRED — call sites pass paths without it.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-host.example/api
